  "description": "Focus Keeper is the ultimate focus timer and Pomodoro timer designed to help you boost productivity and fight against procrastination. Whether you're a student preparing for an exam, managing ADHD, or simply trying to stay focused, this app is here to make your time management easier. By leveraging the original Pomodoro method, Focus Keeper helps you break down your tasks into manageable intervals and balance work with breaks, so you can stay on track without burning out.\n\nWith a built-in study tracker, customizable settings, and an intuitive design, Focus Keeper is ideal for those who need a reliable exam timer or just want to track their progress efficiently.\n\nFocus Keeper: Pomodoro Timer, Exam Timer, ADHD\nPomodoro ΓÇô Stay true to the original technique with 25-minute sessions followed by short breaks to keep your mind sharp.\n\nCustomizable Focus Timer ΓÇô Adjust the length of your sessions, short breaks, and long breaks to suit your workflow.\n\nExam Timer & Study Timer ΓÇô Ideal for students and professionals, the product acts as a perfect exam timer to help you easily manage study sessions.\n\nADHD Friendly ΓÇô Tailored for those with ADHD, the appΓÇÖs structured technique helps improve concentration and task completion.\n\nTime Tracker ΓÇô Track your productivity over time with insightful charts and fight against ADHD and procrastination.\n\nSimple Interface ΓÇô With a clean and intuitive design, it's easy to set up your focus timer and start working on your tasks immediately.\n\nHow Its Works?\nSet Your Focus Timer & Study TimerΓÇô Choose a task and set the clock for 25 minutes.\nWork Until the Rings ΓÇô Stay focused on your task until the Pomodoro rings.\nTake a Short Break ΓÇô Enjoy a 5-minute break after each session to refresh your mind.\nLong Breaks ΓÇô After completing 4 focus sessions, take a longer break of 20-30 minutes to recharge.\nThe app automatically starts the next session, so you can stay productive without interruptions.\n\nWho Can Benefit?\nWhether you're a student needing a reliable study timer for exams, a professional managing multiple tasks, or someone who struggles with ADHD, the concentration app is the perfect tool. The app provides a structured routine, making it easier to avoid distractions and procrastination. Its built-in time tracker and customizable settings ensure that you can stay productive in any environment, from the office to the study room.\n\nWhy ?\nUnlike other apps, Focus Keeper offers an original Pomodoro experience while giving you full control over how you manage your focus sessions. Whether you're using it as an exam timer, a study timer, or to manage ADHD, its versatile features and easy-to-use interface make it stand out. Track your productivity over time, customize your features, and use it as a stopwatch for specific tasks ΓÇô all while avoiding procrastination and staying on task.\n\nRead our terms and conditions at https://www.iubenda.com/terms-and-conditions/36391786\nRead our privacy policy at https://www.iubenda.com/privacy-policy/36391786\n\n[ Support: support@pixo.co ]",
